{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"平\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块本身交代了处境、原因和转折，单看大字也能串起失落、怀念、守住自己和仍未安顿；Y 的加亮词有些只剩“笃定没撑多久”“有了劲头”等，脱离周围小字不够自足。load：X 大块较少但句块较长，Y 加亮片段较多但短，考虑各屏停留时间，两边总体接近平。small：Y 的小字更常补出受过的气、孤单和被当作自己人的具体缘由，且大多贴着当屏推进；core：Y 把提醒自己为何离开与仍舍不得旧日亲近反复拉扯，最后落到不为留人而咽下委屈，比 X 多次抽象重申尊严更有行动线；concise：Y 虽然文字较多，但不少内容推进了孤单、后悔、是否回去等新层次，X 的 S04、S06、S08、S12 对想念不等于回去、不以自尊交换归属有明显复说。human：Y 的“那点高兴还没退”“心里就酸了”“回不回以后再说”等更像日常说话；X 的“重新靠近自己”“按自己认可的尺度对待自己”“撤回对自己的要求”“把它变成回去或留下的决定”偏抽象或搭配不够自然。fine：X 的感受多落在胸口发紧、脚下流沙、想停又强撑等观众体验，Y 的感受栏多次直接写和弦、旋律、步态本身，不完全是在讲观众此刻的体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8a091456-6d4c-4c0e-93bf-6440f429f7ef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T131112452623Z", "elapsed_seconds": 468.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T13:19:00.801780+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bdce5c789f531123c06c0358b387f4230ed2acd84f627277b907cfca71332d0a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_b